    "_comment": "DESIGN.md \u00a711, decided (not in the document). Selling returns this fraction of what was paid for a unit, including its upgrades. Full price within the build phase that bought it, so building by mistake is undoable; half afterwards, so rebuilding the board between waves costs something. Rates are per PURCHASE, not per unit: an upgrade bought this phase refunds in full even on an old body.",
